```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>New Reply Notification</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7fb;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
        }

        a {
            color: #0070f3;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        p {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.3;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: #222222;
        }

        /* Layout */
        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .email-header {
            background-color: #0070f3;
            padding: 28px 24px;
        }

        .email-body {
            padding: 32px 28px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .email-footer {
            padding: 20px 28px;
            background-color: #f6f6f6;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-footer p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #777777;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Notification Box */
        .notification-box {
            margin: 25px 0;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            background-color: #f4f8ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #0070f3;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .notification-box p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .video-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #222222;
        }

        /* Button */
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 10px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #0070f3;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 13px 26px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: #005cc8;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-body {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }

            .email-footer {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>New Reply to Your Question</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">

            <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

            <p>
                Someone has replied to your question in the video:
            </p>

            <div class="notification-box">
                <p>
                    <span class="video-title">"<%= title %>"</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <p>
                A new reply has been added to the discussion. 
                Log in to your LMS account to view the response and continue the conversation.
            </p>

            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="<%= url %>" class="button">
                    View Reply
                </a>
            </div>

            <p>
                Thank you for being a part of our learning community!
            </p>

            <p>
                Best regards,<br>
                <strong>LMS Team</strong>
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>
                If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to
                <a href="mailto:mr.zain903@gmail.com">contact our support team</a>.
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
                © LMS. All rights reserved.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
